dback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 10, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn11le03ob10re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Write a dialogue giving advice to a person who wants to quit their job.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn11le03ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le03ob10re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn11le03ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn11le03ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: So tell me, why did you want to meet? I get the feeling something is up.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Yes. I'm sorry to have kept you in suspense, but I want you to know that things aren't going so well for me here at BFP.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: What? Everyone loves you here!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I don't feel that I'm being given much recognition. In fact, I'm thinking of resigning.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Working here is an amazing opportunity. Give it more time.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I thought so too, but then having done an online test for people about job satisfaction, I realized there were a lot of red flags working here.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: What were the questions?", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn11le03ob10re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: They were things like: <span class=\"italic\">Do you sometimes wake up early, excited about an idea you have?</span> <span class=\"italic\">Does your work allow you to hold true to your personal values?</span>\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I don't see how your work as editorial assistant goes against your personal values.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I value being creative at work. Right now, I am doing a lot of proofreading, but no original writing. From what I see, my potential for career growth is limited.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: No job is perfect. Having met so many great colleagues here, I know we are treated with respect.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: But how will I know if I am good enough to be a real journalist, if I am stuck in a dead-end job?", "time": "38000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn11le03ob10re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Of course you are good enough! We have to play the game. Having been here only a few months, it's too early for us to make a decision like that. We have to prove what we're worth. Gradually, the bosses will give us more responsibility.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: There seems to have been some movement recently in the company.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Yes, I noticed that.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Remember Amanda?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: No, not really. I don't remember having met her before.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Well, she was let go last week. She was felt not to have met the standards required.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: At least you should go talk to Ms. Moore before you make a rash decision.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: OK, I will.", "time": "78500", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Good Prospects", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Am I Good Enough?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Express duty, advice, willingness, or intention to do something in spoken or written texts and in work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "rash", "type": "name"}, {"content": "quick, without thinking", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: At least you should go talk to Ms. Moore about it before you make a rash decision.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about an important decision about work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "job satisfaction", "type": "name"}, {"content": "measurement of how much you enjoy your work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Having done an online test for people about job satisfaction, I realized a lot of things.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "career growth", "type": "name"}, {"content": "advancing in a career field by getting positions with increasing responsibility", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: From what I see, my potential for career growth is limited.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "red flag", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a clue there may be some problems you haven't seen yet", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There were a lot of red flags working here.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "dead-end job", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a job that has no chance for growth potential ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: How will I know if I am good enough to be a real journalist, if I am stuck in a dead-end job?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "recognition", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling you are valued and given credit for your good work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't feel that I'm being given much recognition.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "you have to play the game", "type": "name"}, {"content": " it is necessary to obey rules, meet expectations and follow conventions in a social context (such as the workplace)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Having been here only a few months, it's too early for us to make a decision like that. We have to play the game.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn11le03ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " The Perfect Infinitive", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " The Perfect tenses can be used to talk about how something in the past relates to the present.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " Look at the chart for an outline of the structure and the uses of the Perfect infinitive.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Use (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">seem </span>and <span class=\\\"italic\\\">appear</span>) after linking verbs to refer to a previous time period.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There <span class=\\\"strong\\\">seems to have been </span> a mistake in the report.</span> <br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">The matter <span class=\\\"strong\\\">appears to have been </span>resolved.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"verb + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">to have</span> + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"After phrases that express emotions or feelings\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm <span class=\\\"strong\\\">sorry to have kept </span>the news from you.</span> <br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">She was <span class=\\\"strong\\\">felt to have met </span>the necessary requirements for the position.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" verb + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">to have</span> + past participle\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I'm sorry to have kept you in suspense, but I want you to know that things aren't going so well for me here at BFP.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "There seems to have been some movement recently in the company. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She was felt not to have met the standards required.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Using -ing Forms", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a Perfect -ing form to emphasize a specific thing that happens before another when talking about results and time.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I didn't remember having met</span> them on that occasion.<br>Here, \u201chaving met them\u201d comes first, \u201cremembering\u201d comes next.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Having finished the prep work, she started writing.</span><br> Here, \"writing\" comes first, \u201cfinishing the prep work\u201d comes next.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Having met so many great colleagues here, I know we are treated with respect. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": " Having been here only a few months, it's too early for us to make a decision like that. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I don't remember having met her before.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You can use the \u2013ing form as a noun, as an adjective or as a verb. <br/>For example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\"> Smoking is dangerous. (noun)  He spends his summers at a baseball training camp. (adjective)  I don't like skiing. (verb)</span> <br/> <br/>  When you use -ing as a noun, you may or may not put an article before it.  <br/> For example:<br/>  <span class=\"italic\">Editing takes a great deal of concentration. The editing of the novel will continue for a few weeks yet.  </span> <br/> <br/>You can also use it as a noun phrase.   <br/>For example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">Giving a speech is somewhat daunting. Riding my bicycle to work is invigorating. </span>  <br/> <br/> You can use the -ing form before a noun when it is an adjective. <br/>  For example:</br> <span class=\"italic\"> He was met by a welcoming party of fans at the stadium. Let's go to the dressing room. </span><br/> <br/> You use the \u2013ing form after prepositions.   <br/>For example:  </br><span class=\"italic\">Before coming, you need to speak to Tanya. After discussing it with her, I've changed my mind. I'm looking forward to seeing her again.</span>  <br/> ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "With a partner, discuss the factors of job satisfaction that were mentioned in this lesson.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Think of other factors influencing job satisfaction. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue of 8 - 12 lines. One person wants to quit their job.  They explain why. The other person gives reasons for them to stay.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice your dialogue with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles and practice the dialogue again.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I discuss things that influence job satisfaction.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give reasons for being unhappy at work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give reasons to stay at a job.", "type": "text"}]}]}